{'symbol': 'LNC', 'date': '2021-12-01 11:00:00', 'title': 'LINCOLN FINANCIAL GROUP TO PARTICIPATE IN THE GOLDMAN SACHS U.S. FINANCIAL SERVICES CONFERENCE', 'text': 'RADNOR, PA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--LINCOLN FINANCIAL GROUP (NYSE:LNC) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT DENNIS R. GLASS, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF LINCOLN FINANCIAL GROUP, WILL PRESENT AT THE GOLDMAN SACHS U.S. FINANCIAL SERVICES CONFERENCE ON WEDNESDAY, DECEMBER 8, 2021 AT APPROXIMATELY 10:00 A.M. EASTERN TIME. MR. GLASS WILL PARTICIPATE IN A QUESTION AND ANSWER SESSION COVERING A VARIETY OF INDUSTRY AND COMPANY-SPECIFIC TOPICS. THE LIVE PRESENTATION WILL BE AVAILABLE AT WWW.LFG.COM/WEBCAST. PLEA'}